msgid "Updating standalones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/standalones-and-hvms.rst:73
#: 98f7bb522c4846da9e203680afeeacd8
msgid ""
"When you create a standalone from a template, the standalone is a complete "
"clone of the template, including the entire filesystem. After the moment of "
"creation, the standalone becomes completely independent from the template. "
"Therefore, the standalone will not be updated merely by updating the "
"template from which it was originally cloned. Rather, it must be updated as "
"an independent qube. See :doc:`How to Update </user/how-to-guides/how-to-"
"update>`."
msgstr ""

